    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy geeraharuuse baraá gixsár Yerusalemu ngina hootiyé'. Muu sleémeero oo hatlá' tsawdo kana tleéhh baraá umuúqo múk mibaango heé wák kuwa slay oo baraá gixsadá' hhoohhoo' ar Yerusalemu ga hoót. Mukduú hatlá' gwaleél ina meét baraá gixsaduuín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu mukdá' hotaá Yerusalemu gaa ya/an nguri tsuuqiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá gixsadaá hatlae múk Israeli nee kaahamuusér Mungú, nee múk tlahhoó Laáwiwo, nee xuumuusér afér do', nee xwaylár sagadiyuusér Solomon nina baraá ayeemooín wa hootiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahh'ale awa tlahhoó Yuda nee oo Benyamini nina hootiyé' baraá Yerusalemúr wa aleeró. Mukwí an oo tlahhoó Yuda kudá' Yerusalemu gaa hoot: Ataya garmoó Usia, garmoó Sekaria, garmoó Amaria, garmoó Shefatia, garmoó Mahalaleli, kuká' awa guruú doó Peresi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme Ma'aseya garmoó Baruku, garmoó Kolhose, garmoó Hasaya, garmoó Adaya, garmoó Yoyaribu, garmoó Sekaria heé yaamaá Shilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xwaylár Peresi sleémeero ar gixsár Yerusalemu ngaa hootiyé' a hhawaataá miguuse tsiire tsiyáhh mibeeri lahhoó' nee dakaát.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Benyamini oo Yerusalemu ngaa hootiyé' a ín Salu, garmoó Meshulamu, garmoó Yoedi, garmoó Pedaya, garmoó Kolaya, garmoó Ma'aseya, garmoó Itieli, garmoó Yeshaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá Gabai nee Salaiwo, muu dinkwaaro a tsiire gwaleél mibeeri tsár nee dakaát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoeli garmoó Sikri, inós an geeraharusmooín, nee Yuda garmoó Hasenua an heé tsár uraywo baraá gixsaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér Mungú, ar aa Yerusalemúr wa hot a Yedaya garmoó Yoyaribu, nee Yakini,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seraya garmoó Hilkia, garmoó Meshulamu, garmoó Sadoki, garmoó Merayoti, garmoó Ahitubu, kuduú doó Mungú gu sagesihhimiít, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dinkwa nee hhaeeín kudá' naa gadiyuusiye' baraá doó Mungú wa aleeró. Inooín a tsiire dakaát mibeeri tsár nee tsár. Slám dinkwa nee kukae oo hatlá' a Adaya garmoó Yerohamu, garmoó Pelalia, garmoó Amsi, garmoó Sekaria, garmoó Pashuri, garmoó Malkiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sleeme hhaeewós kudaá geeraharuusér tlahhi'i dinkwaaro a tsiire tsár mibeeri tsiyáhh nee tsár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amashai garmoó Asareli, garmoó Ahsai, garmoó Meshilemoti garmoó Imeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dinkwa nee hhaeeine a hhawaataá miguuse tsiiruú wák mibeeri tsár nee dakaát, geeraharusmooín a Sabdieli garmoó Hagedolimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
