          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi oo Yerusalemu gaa hoot a kwí: Shemaya garmoó Hashubu, garmoó Asrikamu, garmoó Hashabia, garmoó Buni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Shabetai nee Yosabadi, geeraharuusér múk Laáwi, inooín a sagesihhtuusér gadiyér tsee/a ar doó Mungú, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Matania garmoó Mika, garmoó Sabdi, xwaylár Asafu kudá' firór ilahhooa ga geeraharahaár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Bakbukia a ale/iisusmoowós, dinkwa nee inooine awa hatlá' a Abda garmoó Shamua, garmoó Galali, xwaylár Yedutuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi kudá' baraá gixsadá' hhoohhoo' ar Yerusalemu ngaa hootiye', dinkwaaro a tsiire tsár mibeeri dakaát nee tsiyáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumuusér afkú do' a Akubu nee Talmoni dinkwa nee hhaeeín kudá' afkú doó xuumá', inooín a tsiiruú wák mibeeri faanqw nee tsár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
